'''Frontline Assault IRON LEGION''' (革命軍隊アイアンウォーズ, ''Kakumei Guntai Aianwōzu'', '''Revolutionary Army Iron Wars''') is the 9th regular gacha event in the game. First campaign was held from November 15th, to November 19th, 2016. All [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]]/[[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rares]] in this set are effective against [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie enemies]] and also have [[Zombie Killer]].

To unlock this banner in [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], the player needs to clear [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] in [[Empire of Cats]] ('''JP''' and '''WW''').

